{"text1": "Hola, ¿cómo estás?", "text2": "Hello, how are you?", "metadata": {"date": "2024-06-01"}}
{"text1": "¿Qué hora es?", "text2": "What time is it?", "metadata": {"date": "2024-06-02"}}
